{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1040", "sample_idx": 30, "model_name": "stockmark/stockmark-2-100b-instruct", "content": "\"\n**MATTHIAS ALGIES**\n\n**PROFILE**\n\nA HIGHLY MOTIVATED INDIVIDUAL WITH A PROVEN TRACK RECORD IN LEADERSHIP AND PROJECT MANAGEMENT. PROVEN ABILITY TO DRIVE RESULTS THROUGH STRONG COMMUNICATION AND TEAMWORK.\n\n**KEY SKILLS**\n\n- LEADERSHIP: EXPERTISE IN MOTIVATING AND GUIDING TEAMS TO ACHIEVE COMMON GOALS.\n- PROJECT MANAGEMENT: PROVEN ABILITY TO PLAN, ORGANIZE, AND CONTROL PROJECTS FROM INCEPTION TO COMPLETION.\n- COMMUNICATION: EFFECTIVE IN BOTH VERBAL AND WRITTEN COMMUNICATION, WITH THE ABILITY TO EXPLAIN COMPLEX CONCEPTS IN SIMPLE TERMS.\n- TEAMWORK: EXCELLENT ABILITY TO WORK COLLABORATIVELY WITH DIVERSE TEAM MEMBERS TO ACHIEVE SHARED OBJECTIVES.\n- ANALYTICAL THINKING: STRONG PROBLEM-SOLVING SKILLS TO ANALYZE DATA AND MAKE INFORMED DECISIONS.\n- ADAPTABILITY: FLEXIBLE AND ABLE TO THRIVE IN CHANGING ENVIRONMENTS, SHOWCASING THE ABILITY TO LEARN AND ADAPT QUICKLY.\n\n**EXPERIENCE**\n\n**PROJECT MANAGER, XYZ CORPORATION**\n\n- LED A MULTIDISCIPLINARY TEAM OF 15 MEMBERS TO SUCCESSFULLY COMPLETE A LARGE-SCALE PRODUCT DEVELOPMENT PROJECT, MEETING ALL DEADLINES AND BUDGET TARGETS.\n- IMPLEMENTED EFFECTIVE COMMUNICATION CHANNELS TO ENSURE OPEN LINES OF COMMUNICATION BETWEEN STAKEHOLDERS AND TEAM MEMBERS.\n- MONITORED PROGRESS AND MADE DATA-DRIVEN DECISIONS TO OPTIMIZE PROJECT PERFORMANCE AND ENSURE QUALITY OUTPUTS.\n\n**TEAM LEADER, ABC ORGANIZATION**\n\n- PROVIDED GUIDANCE AND SUPPORT TO A TEAM OF 10 MEMBERS, FOSTERING A POSITIVE AND PRODUCTIVE WORK ENVIRONMENT.\n- COLLABORATED WITH CROSS-FUNCTIONAL TEAMS TO DEVELOP AND IMPLEMENT INNOVATIVE SOLUTIONS TO BUSINESS CHALLENGES.\n- ENSURED TEAM MEMBERS WERE ALIGNED WITH ORGANIZATIONAL GOALS AND PROVIDED FEEDBACK TO IMPROVE PERFORMANCE.\n\n**EDUCATION**\n\n- BACHELOR OF BUSINESS ADMINISTRATION, UNIVERSITY OF XYZ, 2015-2019\n\n**ADDITIONAL CREDENTIALS**\n\n- PROJECT MANAGEMENT PROFESSIONAL (PMP) CERTIFICATION, PROJECT MANAGEMENT INSTITUTE, 2020\n\n**KEY WORDS IN ALL CAPS COUNT: 7**\n\"", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"", "logprob": -0.02717847004532814}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -2.0149474143981934}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -1.1825480461120605}, {"token": "MAT", "logprob": -0.3417459726333618}, {"token": "TH", "logprob": -0.006531202234327793}, {"token": "I", "logprob": -4.3987260141875595e-05}, {"token": "AS", "logprob": -0.00013100242358632386}, {"token": " AL", "logprob": -0.002946204738691449}, {"token": "G", "logprob": -1.4346448183059692}, {"token": "IES", "logprob": -0.08715826272964478}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.03035137616097927}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.032705340534448624}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.02211376465857029}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.31873399019241333}, {"token": "PRO", "logprob": -0.596718966960907}, {"token": "FILE", "logprob": -0.7687971591949463}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.07428024709224701}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.09144643694162369}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -1.2700303792953491}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -1.0897263288497925}, {"token": " HIGH", "logprob": -1.6312241554260254}, {"token": "LY", "logprob": -0.023773498833179474}, {"token": " MOT", "logprob": -0.6452563405036926}, {"token": "IV", "logprob": -5.721882189391181e-05}, {"token": "ATED", "logprob": -0.00011503035057103261}, {"token": " IND", "logprob": -1.0766801834106445}, {"token": "IV", "logprob": -0.005239564459770918}, {"token": "ID", "logprob": -3.540453326422721e-05}, {"token": "UAL", "logprob": -1.4305104514278355e-06}, {"token": " WITH", "logprob": -0.029923396185040474}, {"token": " A", "logprob": -0.24846474826335907}, {"token": " PRO", "logprob": -0.8912804126739502}, {"token": "VEN", "logprob": -0.07639069855213165}, {"token": " TR", "logprob": -0.0643114522099495}, {"token": "ACK", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " REC", "logprob": -0.0004786299541592598}, {"token": "ORD", "logprob": -1.9073468138230965e-06}, {"token": " IN", "logp